Martial Tradition - Highlander	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Gallowglass Training|Duelist Sphere	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment Sphere	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Spheres Equipment Bonus Talent|-1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Highlander Tradition Choice 1|1	DESC:Highlanders are the inhabitants or soldiers who fight for or on behalf of the highlands, a cold, wet, and mountainous terrain. Well adapted to the climate, they make for decent adventurers, being trained in a variety of weapons, which they often dual wield. Equipment: Gallowglass Training Duelist sphere Variable: Dual Wielding or Scout sphere, and one additional talent from the chosen sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions#toc35
Martial Tradition - Free Runner	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Athletics Sphere|Athletics - Expanded Training|Athletics - Wall Stunt	ABILITY:Spheres Athletics Package|AUTOMATIC|Athletics Package - Run|Athletics Package - Leap	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Spheres Athletics Package|-2	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Free Runner Tradition Choice 1|1	DESC:Free runners treat the world as their gymnasium, practicing wild acrobatics, running on and leaping from surfaces most wouldn’t consider even climbing. Bonus Talents: Equipment: none Athletics sphere [run] package, Expanded Training [leap] and one other package, Wall Stunt Variable: Free runners gain a talent of their choice from the Athletics sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions#toc28
