Martial Tradition - Bushido Warrior	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Armor Training|Equipment - Bushido Training|Duelist Sphere	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment Sphere	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Spheres Equipment Bonus Talent|-1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Bushido Warrior Tradition Choice 1|1	DESC:Training in the bushido way includes learning how to wear the ceremonial armor of your station, as well as wield weapons like the katana and longbow. Some bushido warriors also train in horsemanship, while others perfect the art of single combat. Bonus Talents: Equipment: Armor Training, Bushido Training Duelist sphere Variable: Followers of the bushido way gain either the Beastmastery base sphere [Ride package], or Draw Cut from the Duelist sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions#toc9
