Martial Tradition - Imperialist	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment - Firearm Proficiency|Equipment - Knightly Training|Duelist Sphere	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment Sphere	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Spheres Equipment Bonus Talent|-1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Imperialist Tradition Choice 1|1	DESC:Imperialists are the soldiers who fight for or on behalf of the empire. Well trained, and equipped for the part, they make for decent adventurers, being trained in the tools of war. Equipment: Firearm Proficiency, Knightly Training Duelist sphere Variable: Beastmastery [ride] package or Warleader sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions#toc36
